 <section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div class="panel-icon">01</div><div><h2>Paquetes disponibles</h2><p>Se calculan con los precios actuales al agregarlos a un presupuesto</p></div><div class="package-head-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" id="packageRestoreDefaults" hidden>Restaurar predeterminados</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="packageNew">+ Nuevo paquete</button></div></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="tech-package-grid" id="packageCards"></div></div></section>
